<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">alchemist-routes</ansi>

The Alchemist is a neutral lineage. At level 10 it promotes to one of three
classes, and any alignment may choose any of them. Each class adds four ranks
(10, 15, 20, 25); a talent adds more (<ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>).

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Apothecary</ansi>

  10 Potent draughts    Healing Draught heals 30% more
  15 Deep satchel       +4 flasks in the satchel
  20 Splash draught     a Healing Draught also heals the next most hurt ally for
                        30% as much
  25 Clean draught      a Healing Draught also takes one harmful status off its
                        patient (once a battle for each ally)

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Bombardier</ansi>

  10 Hotter flasks      Fire Flask burns at 100% of Sparks (from 70%)
  15 Wide throw         Fire Flask reaches one more foe
  20 Pitch and tar      foes a Fire Flask burns are left alight (2 damage a round
                        for 4 rounds)
  25 Deep satchel       +4 flasks in the satchel

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Mutagenist</ansi>

  10 Mutagen            Bracing Tonic also hardens its ally: +10 armor for the
                        battle, for a tenth of the ally's health
  15 Stable mutagen     a Mutagen costs a twentieth of the ally's health
  20 Strong mutagen     a Mutagen gives +15 armor, and a Bracing Tonic lasts 2
                        rounds longer
  25 Pure mutagen       a Mutagen costs its ally no health

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Elite classes</ansi> (level 30, neutral, any alignment; <ansi fg="command">help elite</ansi>)

  <ansi fg="command">help panacean</ansi>     Panacean, the Apothecary route: an Elixir that keeps a falling ally standing
  <ansi fg="command">help grenadier</ansi>    Grenadier, the Bombardier route: Fire Flask bursts over four, then five foes
  <ansi fg="command">help transmuter</ansi>   Transmuter, the Mutagenist route: a Mutagen that hardens a whole row

<ansi fg="yellow-bold">Talents</ansi>

Deep Satchel (+2 flasks), Steady Brew (Healing Draught heals 10% more), Hot Brew (Fire Flask burns 10% harder), and the shared
Toughness and Footwork (<ansi fg="command">help talents</ansi>).

See also: <ansi fg="command">help alchemist</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help promotion</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help classes</ansi>.
